@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: Human-Readable Sizes
  "Formats byte counts for columnar CLI output using binary (1024) units."

  Provides:
    - output.HumanSize @source("symbol:HumanSize")

  Invariants:
    - Values under 1024 bytes MUST render as N B
    - Larger values MUST use K/M/G/T/P/E binary units with one decimal place

  Scenario (happy-path): Small file
    Given 5 bytes
    When HumanSize runs
    Then it returns 5 B

  Scenario (happy-path): Megabyte scale
    Given 4412345 bytes
    When HumanSize runs
    Then it returns a compact binary MB string
